--- Increment/Decrement Tester ---
Initial i = 5
--- Post-Increment ---
LET j = i++
j = 5 (should be 5)
i = 6 (should be 6)
--- Pre-Increment ---
LET k = ++i
k = 7 (should be 7)
i = 7 (should be 7)
--- Post-Decrement ---
LET m = i--
m = 7 (should be 7)
i = 6 (should be 6)
--- Pre-Decrement ---
LET n = --i
n = 5 (should be 5)
i = 5 (should be 5)
--- Test on Lists ---
my_list[1]++ = 20
my_list[1] = 21
++my_list[1] = 22
my_list[1] = 22
--- COMPREHENSIVE INCREMENT/DECREMENT TEST ---

[Section 1] Basic Variables
Initial a: 10
Post-Increment (a++): 10 (Expected: 10)
Value after: 11 (Expected: 11)
Pre-Increment (++a): 12 (Expected: 12)
Value after: 12 (Expected: 12)
Post-Decrement (a--): 12 (Expected: 12)
Value after: 11 (Expected: 11)
Pre-Decrement (--a): 10 (Expected: 10)
Value after: 10 (Expected: 10)

[Section 2] List Elements
Initial list[0]: 100
Post-Inc list[0]++: 100 (Expected: 100)
Value after: 101 (Expected: 101)
Pre-Inc ++list[0]: 102 (Expected: 102)
Value after: 102 (Expected: 102)

[Section 3] Object Properties (The Fix)
  [Public Test]
  Initial: 10
  THIS.pub_val++: 10 (Expected: 10)
  After: 11 (Expected: 11)
  ++THIS.pub_val: 12 (Expected: 12)

  [Private Test - REQUIRED FIX]
  Initial: 10
  THIS.priv_val++: 10 (Expected: 10)
  After: 11 (Expected: 11)
  ++THIS.priv_val: 12 (Expected: 12)
  After: 12 (Expected: 12)
  THIS.priv_val--: 12 (Expected: 12)
  --THIS.priv_val: 10 (Expected: 10)

--- TEST: CONSTANT PROTECTION ---
Success: Caught expected error on PI++ -> Cannot reassign constant 'PI'
--- FINAL INCREMENT/DECREMENT ROBUSTNESS TEST ---

[1] Standard Functionality
Initial a: 10
a++ (Post): 10 -> a is now 11
++a (Pre):  12 -> a is now 12

[2] Private Member Access
Private val: 5
++THIS.val:  6 (Should be 6)

[3] Constant Protection Tests
Constant PI = 3.14

--- Test A: Post-Increment (PI++) ---
SUCCESS: Caught expected error -> Cannot reassign constant 'PI'

--- Test B: Pre-Increment (++PI) ---
SUCCESS: Caught expected error -> Cannot reassign constant 'PI'

--- Test C: Post-Decrement (PI--) ---
SUCCESS: Caught expected error -> Cannot reassign constant 'PI'

--- Test D: Pre-Decrement (--PI) ---
SUCCESS: Caught expected error -> Cannot reassign constant 'PI'

